-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Astronomy Engine

AstronomyKit also includes the complete VSOP87B data and the 77 IAU2000B
nutation coefficient rows from Astronomy Engine revision
826e26ff3a6dc03ee46658b1138fef582d96c5d9, checked in as the C tables
Sources/CLibAstronomy/generated/vsop87b_full.h and iau2000b_full.h. The Swift
table Sources/AstronomyKit/Engine/Planets/Generated/VSOP87BTerms.swift is
generated from vsop87b_full.h. VSOP87 is the planetary theory of Pierre
Bretagnon and Gerard Francou (Bureau des Longitudes).

